! ===========================================================================
! samsung-tv-telemetry.blocklist
! Telemetry, ACR (viewing-history fingerprinting), advertising and device-log
! endpoints for Samsung Tizen smart TVs.
!
! Format: Adblock-Plus style, one rule per line.
!   ||domain^      block the domain and every subdomain
!   @@||domain^    never block (KEEP) - these win over block rules
!   /^regex$/      block when the regular expression matches
!
! DESIGN RULE: this profile blocks TELEMETRY ONLY.
! Every host that serves firmware, time sync, DRM/licensing, the app store,
! account sign-in, TV Plus streaming or playback is deliberately ALLOWED and
! listed as a KEEP rule at the bottom. When in doubt, it stays allowed.
!
! The KEEP list matters as much as the block list: an over-broad list breaks
! the device, and a device that does not work is not a private device.
!
! Measured against Tizen 6.x and 9.x firmware. Review it against your own
! query log before trusting it.
! ===========================================================================

! --- Viewing history, ACR fingerprinting, advertising, device logs ---
